        "views:en:Sovetsky_Soyuz-class_battleship:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:32Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, the most readers were in Russian, with 257.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Sovetsky_Soyuz-class_battleship:2026-11-02",
        "views:ru:Линейные_корабли_проекта_23:2026-11-02"
